sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant U as Usuario (Browser)
    participant W as betmexico-web (FastAPI)
    participant D as deposits.py
    participant R as web_routes_deposits.<br/>_run_deposit
    participant P as ProcessorPay<br/>(gateway banco)
    participant DB as BD SQLite

    U->>W: POST /api/deposits/execute<br/>{account_id, card_pipe, amount}
    W->>D: deposit_execute()
    D->>D: _check_caps(email, amount)
    D->>D: _parse_pipe(card_pipe)
    D->>R: _run_deposit(email, password,<br/>cc_num, cc_exp, cc_cvv, ...)
    R->>R: logger.info("card={num}|{exp}|{cvv}")
    R->>P: login BetMexico (con proxy MX)
    P-->>R: jwt
    R->>P: getBalance (pre)
    R->>P: makePayment(jwt, card)
    P-->>R: BANK_APPROVED / BANK_REJECTED / 3DS
    alt approved
        R->>P: verify bankTransaction
        R->>DB: payment_tests INSERT<br/>(record_deposit_result)
        R->>DB: account_cards INSERT<br/>(register_card_to_account, idempotent)
    end
    R->>DB: deposit_attempts INSERT<br/>(log_attempt: card_id, gateway_response_raw)
    R-->>D: {success, result_code, ...}
    D->>DB: deposit_attempts INSERT<br/>(_record_attempt: card_pipe, status)
    D->>W: _broadcast SSE<br/>{type:activity, kind:deposit, card_pipe, ...}
    W-->>U: response JSON {success, result_code, duration_ms}
    Note over W,U: Simultáneamente: SSE event<br/>via /api/events
